    "body": "## Summary\n- add bounded per-client/per-endpoint rate limiting for public `GET /jobs` and `GET /jobs/nearby`\n- return `429` with `Retry-After` and fail closed when the bounded bucket map is saturated\n- ignore `X-Forwarded-For` by default; allow explicit trust only behind a controlled reverse proxy\n- expose production configuration through `application-prod.yml` and production Compose\n- add focused unit coverage and deployment/security documentation\n\n## Why\nPublic job discovery is intentionally anonymous but can trigger filtered database queries and geospatial nearby searches. Controller pagination/radius/result validation bounds individual requests but did not bound request frequency, leaving a resource-exhaustion/abuse gap.\n\n## Validation\nRequired before merge: Maven verify, frontend tests/lint/build, production Compose contract and runtime/container smokes. No Flyway migration is required because this slice adds no persistent state.",
